{"data": [{"author_id": "1175040334188953600", "created_at": "2026-11-09T11:52:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119759915900154306"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/hUOnf0t2Ru", "end": 123, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/laomunova/status/2119759915900154306/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119759910342639616", "start": 100, "url": "https://t.co/hUOnf0t2Ru"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/hUOnf0t2Ru", "end": 123, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/laomunova/status/2119759915900154306/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119759910376251392", "start": 100, "url": "https://t.co/hUOnf0t2Ru"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/hUOnf0t2Ru", "end": 123, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/laomunova/status/2119759915900154306/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119759910359429120", "start": 100, "url": "https://t.co/hUOnf0t2Ru"}]}, "id": "2119759915900154306", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 5570, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "聊一聊《天道》丁元英原型，禅师李彪。\n\n1969年，李彪出生在一个军人家庭，传闻他是某位上柱国的孙子，但他从未承认也从未否认。他的数学天赋极高，高中时参加全国数学竞赛拿了二等奖，大学直接进入数学系。 https://t.co/hUOnf0t2Ru", "url": "https://x.com/laomunova/status/2119759915900154306"}, {"author_id": "1675569553764659200", "created_at": "2026-11-09T12:01:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119762175724028039"], "id": "2119762175724028039", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 625, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "断轮刑是中世纪欧洲的招牌：人四肢摊开绑在车轮的辐条上，行刑人抡起包铁的木棍，隔着轮辐，一根一根敲断骨头\n骨头断尽，再把轮子竖上高柱，人缠在轮子里示众，断气为止，快的一日，慢的两三日\n🇫🇷 法国、🇩🇪 德国用它对付杀人越货的重犯，一用就是上千年\n1762", "url": "https://x.com/zhangxianh0725/status/2119762175724028039"}, {"author_id": "2075033822778040320", "created_at": "2026-11-09T16:17:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119826808015298789"], "id": "2119826808015298789", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "缠